## Development

```
portaki dev --watch   # build and deploy to the sandbox on every save
portaki check         # the gate portaki release applies
portaki release       # push, sign and announce
```

The version lives in `Cargo.toml` only. There is no manifest to write: `portaki build` reads `portaki_module!`, `#[surface]`, `#[email]`, the `portaki-sdk` features and `i18n/`.

